  "label": "AWS Secrets Manager JSON API",
  "description": "AWS Secrets Manager API 2017-10-17 via OfficialApiNode, signed with AWS SigV4 (service secretsmanager). Docs: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/apireference/Welcome.html. Operations: get-secret (GetSecretValue), put-secret (CreateSecret), update-secret, delete-secret, list-secrets, rotate-secret, describe-secret, listen. Auth secrets access_key_id, secret_access_key, optional session_token are instance config only (never on INPUT, never logged). Retrieved SecretString/SecretBinary must not be logged and should stay in StudioQuack secret bindings. listen is kind:ingress — use a BPMN message start/catch/boundary event. JDK HTTP, official API only. Errors raise a BPMN error for the error boundary event (INVALID_INPUT, AUTH_FAILED, RATE_LIMITED, HTTP_<status>, REQUEST_FAILED); secrets are redacted.",
